288
00:08:51,888 --> 00:08:54,225
Alex sees something new in his classrooms.

289
00:08:54,638 --> 00:08:56,225
Grades used to form a bell curve.

290
00:08:56,638 --> 00:08:58,038
Now they split into two groups.

291
00:08:58,462 --> 00:09:01,050
Students who use AI to quiz themselves and

292
