295
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:08,938
Be the head,

296
00:09:09,312 --> 00:09:09,912
not the tail.

297
00:09:10,325 --> 00:09:11,588
And learn the basics anyway.

298
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,100
We've had calculators for seventy years,

299
00:09:14,275 --> 00:09:15,125
Alex points out,

