311
00:09:37,538 --> 00:09:39,750
Ankur's advice is the one that sticks.

312
00:09:40,162 --> 00:09:42,150
Stop optimizing to look good on paper.

313
00:09:42,575 --> 00:09:43,825
When he started at MIT,

314
00:09:44,138 --> 00:09:45,575
Sanjeev Arora told him:

315
00:09:45,950 --> 00:09:47,662
the easiest way to get tenure is to

316
00:09:47,675 --> 00:09:49,025
