319
00:09:52,038 --> 00:09:53,050
Pretend you've already won.

320
00:09:53,462 --> 00:09:54,425
Then ask what you would do.

321
00:09:54,838 --> 00:09:57,050
And remember Alex on the day Fermat's Last

322
00:09:57,062 --> 00:09:57,675
Theorem fell?

