00:10:00,975 --> 00:10:02,350
Lex closes with this thought.

326
00:10:02,762 --> 00:10:04,575
As AI makes intelligence cheap,

327
00:10:04,888 --> 00:10:07,038
we may finally realize it was always the

328
00:10:07,050 --> 00:10:07,950
